# Per-Dockerfile ignore (BuildKit): applies only when building with
# `-f cloud-service/Dockerfile`. It restores the isolation the narrower
# per-service build context used to give, now that the context has to be apps/
# so Maven can see the in-repo starter: the edge service's source never reaches
# the daemon at all, let alone the image.
cloud-service/

# Build output and local state never belong in a build context.
**/target/
**/*.iml
